{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/extras/f7dd575e3c960c0ee0a8fa4a7fcf45c4.avif?t=1768605550\" width=1200 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astrolite is a fast-paced survival roguelite set in space. Fight across the solar system annihilating the world guardians defending their planets against you in a conquest to eliminate all in your way. Upgrade unique weapons and develop your own gameplay combinations to aid in defeating a relentless onslaught of asteroids out to stop you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450850/extras/dc736877e19d8a9f58cdcc6e5c2119be.avif?t=1768605550\" width=1200 height=250 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-firing weapons with manual aiming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast runs ( &lt; 30 minutes )</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect XP Orbs to level up, selecting over 12 passives to empower you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize over 15 unique weapons with style-specific tags</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade weapons and passives an unlimited amount of times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock characters with vastly different playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against over 16 unique asteroids, 6 bosses, and 9 World Guardians all tied to respective planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive on planets for 180 seconds in a bullet heaven style, destroying as many asteroids as possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat World Guardians defending each planet one-on-one at the end of survivals in a bullet-hell styled arena</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steam